  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_033 (scvi_n200 RNA, resnet50 image, transformer aggregation, weighted fusion) achieves the highest accuracy so far (0.713). This experiment tests replacing the image encoder with a more powerful one (imagenet_vit_l) while keeping RNA encoder, aggregation, and fusion consistent. This isolates the effect of the image encoder, a critical design choice, to determine if upgrading it could further improve performance. It balances exploitation (building on the current best) and exploration (testing a key component change)."
